ext﻿[Script Info]; Script generated by Aegisub 3.2.2; http://www.aegisub.org/Title: Default Aegisub fileScriptType: v4.00+WrapStyle: 0ScaledBorderAndShadow: yesYCbCr Matrix: TV.601PlayResX: 1280PlayResY: 720Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.27,0:02:16.07,Title,,0,0,0,,We're Not in HellDialogue: 1,0:02:08.27,0:02:16.07,Title,,0,0,0,,We're Not in HellDialogue: 0,0:02:03.40,0:02:05.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy,Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.90,0:02:08.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,hurry up and get over here!Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.73,0:02:53.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're all set to depart anytime now!Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.82,0:02:56.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once Luffy gets back, we can set sail!Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.07,0:02:57.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay.Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.99,0:03:08.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look, simply put, there are about as many battleships as there are of us.Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.80,0:03:13.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if we do set sail, it's virtually impossible to get out of here.Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.54,0:03:16.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is a report from northwest of the main gate.Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.14,0:03:19.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have retrieved all Enies Lobby's marines and officials.Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.60,0:03:22.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Also, at the main gate,Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.43,0:03:26.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we identified about fifty pirates— including the giants—escaping the main island.Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.93,0:03:28.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's those guys!Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.00,0:03:34.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's Zambai and the others! See! I told you! They escaped the island just fine!Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.30,0:03:36.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wasn't worried about them at all!Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.51,0:03:40.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really, they wouldn't die! Not even if you killed them!Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.28,0:03:43.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just the other day–Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.63,0:03:47.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have completely eliminated them with a barrage of cannon fire.Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.57,0:03:49.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All are confirmed dead.Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.54,0:03:53.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Under these circumstances, it's impossible to survive on the main island.Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.96,0:03:57.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hence, the number of survivors on Enies Lobby's main island is zero!Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.63,0:04:02.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Reporting from Battleship 2.Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.71,0:04:06.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The courthouse and the Tower of Justice located in the southeast of the island,Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.64,0:04:09.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,as well as the underground passage that leads to the bridge,Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.32,0:04:11.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,have all been destroyed.Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.26,0:04:16.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The only target left is the Bridge of Hesitation.Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.87,0:04:30.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky!Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.72,0:04:34.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those guys!Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.61,0:04:41.55,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Alright, you guys go straight to the courthouse and meet up with Straw Hat-san.Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.10,0:04:45.46,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,We're gonna split into two groups and bring down that drawbridge.Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.27,0:04:49.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Galley-La's shipwrights, too?Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.45,0:04:55.39,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,When you see those guys, tell them,Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.03,0:04:59.19,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,"You're fired."Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.09,0:05:02.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oimo! Kashi!Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.94,0:05:05.61,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,How...Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.61,0:05:07.74,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,dare you...Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.74,0:05:09.78,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,deceive us?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.36,0:05:14.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I guess Yokozuna was with them, too.Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.83,0:05:18.29,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Do you wanna come along?Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.21,0:05:28.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sodom and Gomorrah, too! Everyone!Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.21,0:05:38.44,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,He says, "I'll be faithful to Big Bro Franky for the rest of my life!"Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.73,0:05:51.23,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,That trench mortar hit him in the chest!Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.23,0:05:52.83,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Get over here before he falls!Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.83,0:05:56.58,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,No one's getting saved  unless you guys keep moving!Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.51,0:06:00.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How is it...Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.07,0:06:02.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that people can die so easily?Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.00,0:06:06.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't see people on a map.Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.41,0:06:14.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They just erased a small island from the world map, all without a shred of emotion.Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.02,0:06:17.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's what a buster call is!Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.41,0:06:28.86,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Bro! We came to rescue you-waina!Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.86,0:06:31.69,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Bro! Come home with us!Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.37,0:06:38.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.81,0:06:42.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your friends are here waiting for you!Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.38,0:06:45.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare die on us!Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.31,0:06:51.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky!Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.92,0:06:55.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rubber Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.26,0:06:57.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jet Pistol!Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.57,0:07:03.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He jumped backwards to reduce the impact!Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.90,0:07:06.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Finger Pistol!Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.91,0:07:20.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jet Bullet!Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.67,0:07:28.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Twin Jet Pistol!Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.43,0:07:38.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rubber Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.38,0:07:41.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll show you...Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.63,0:07:46.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,my most potent technique, one that pushes the Six Powers to their limit!Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.00,0:07:48.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Six Powers Esoterica:Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.32,0:07:52.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Six King Gun!Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.23,0:08:19.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's like... the impact dials from Sky Island,Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.64,0:08:26.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but it's several times more powerful!Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.11,0:08:29.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tempest Kick: Victory Bird!Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.13,0:08:35.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.41,0:08:39.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lucci is powerful.Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.62,0:08:43.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If Straw Hat hadn't held him back in there,Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.96,0:08:47.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to be honest, I don't know how many of us would've died.Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.30,0:08:51.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know, sometimes I feel...Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.40,0:08:58.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy always knows from the start the person he has to fight.Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.31,0:09:02.14,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,I'm definitely gonna beat up that pigeon guy.Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.75,0:09:05.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He just has animal instincts... even better than your own.Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.39,0:09:14.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have a report, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.71,0:09:17.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy is in the first column!Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.61,0:09:19.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So he's alive?Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.03,0:09:23.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell all ships to take position around the Bridge of Hesitation!Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.67,0:09:25.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yes, sir! – Let's go! Hurry up!Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.00,0:09:32.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He won't... die, right?Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.99,0:09:35.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you an idiot?Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.22,0:09:37.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.13,0:09:39.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Only an idiot calls others idiots!Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.68,0:10:00.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's going on?Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.00,0:10:02.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The wall?Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.53,0:10:07.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The first column is now cut off!Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.20,0:10:18.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They destroyed half the bridge!Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.04,0:10:19.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why'd they do that?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.17,0:10:25.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mr. Rob Lucci of CP9 and Straw Hat Luffy are in the first column!Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.74,0:10:29.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The battleships are coming this way!Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.15,0:10:34.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All ships, take position around the Bridge of Hesitation!Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.32,0:10:37.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,On both the bridge and escort ship,Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.36,0:10:41.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we have identified nine pirates, including Pirate Hunter Zoro and Nico Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.30,0:10:46.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It appears that they're the main culprits who defeated CP9 in the Tower of Justice!Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.35,0:10:51.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They'll recapture Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.85,0:10:54.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're not gonna let them!Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.43,0:11:00.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At any rate, they're fierce.Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.29,0:11:03.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The legendary Enies Lobby has stood impregnable for 800 years,Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.37,0:11:07.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,all because CP9 has watched over it for many generations.Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.52,0:11:10.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And yet, a single group of pirates defeated CP9,Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.06,0:11:13.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and their captain can contend with Mr. Rob Lucci, of all people.Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.09,0:11:17.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It seems that Straw Hat Luffy is no mere rookie.Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.03,0:11:20.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But he can't defeat Mr. Lucci.Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.11,0:11:24.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And we will clearly annihilate his crew here.Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.32,0:11:26.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the end of the road for these villains.Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.00,0:11:29.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, look over there!Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.51,0:11:47.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.60,0:11:50.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're here!Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.86,0:11:53.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We all got to the bridge, safe and sound!Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.90,0:11:58.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're okay!Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.66,0:12:01.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry about us, Luffy-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.50,0:12:03.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We rescued Robin-chan, too!Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.19,0:12:08.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All that's left is for you to beat him!Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.72,0:12:10.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take him down, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.12,0:12:11.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll all make it through this...Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.53,0:12:13.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and leave this place!Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.20,0:12:31.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now it's just a matter of how long we can hold them off.Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.30,0:12:42.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's as you said, your friends are all still alive. Incredible.Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.03,0:12:48.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But we'll see if you still have that look on your face a few minutes from now.Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.23,0:12:50.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evil cannot be allowed to thrive in this world!Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.08,0:12:53.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stand down if ranked lieutenant commander or below!Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.08,0:12:59.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As for the 200 elite captains and commanders, eliminate the enemy on the double!Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.84,0:13:02.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C-Captains from Headquarters?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.51,0:13:05.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're in the same class as that Smoker freak!Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.32,0:13:08.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're taking on that many guys at that level?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.51,0:13:10.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's proof they're scared of us.Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.56,0:13:12.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Grandma, I'm scared.Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.78,0:13:31.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm? Where's Sanji?Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.19,0:13:33.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He was here just a moment ago.Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.79,0:13:37.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? Where'd that idiot cook go at a time like this?Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.29,0:13:41.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All hands prepare for battle! Move out!Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.32,0:13:45.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.07,0:13:54.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Talk is cheap; bring it on already!Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.77,0:13:59.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nice. I get to go wild one more time.Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.53,0:14:03.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll draw the line here and give it everything we've got!Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.91,0:14:06.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold your ground until Luffy gets back, no matter the cost!Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.78,0:14:10.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have to get off the ship! If it's damaged, we'll lose our chance to escape!Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.84,0:14:12.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They will never catch me again!Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.54,0:14:19.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't move!Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.00,0:14:21.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Attack!Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.55,0:14:26.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Recover Nico Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.47,0:14:31.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't let them take her back after having come so far!Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.73,0:14:35.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Two hundred elites from Navy Headquarters? Fine by me!Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.45,0:14:37.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But there are so many of them!Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.00,0:14:39.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Weapons...Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.06,0:14:41.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Left!Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.23,0:14:47.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Only dealing with one or two at a time is such a hassle. Attack me all at once!Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.04,0:14:52.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Feel the power of Sogeking!Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.87,0:14:54.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sunflower Star!Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.83,0:15:06.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you're looking for a fight using guns and cannons?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.29,0:15:10.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take this!Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.59,0:15:13.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That doesn't work on me!Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.66,0:15:15.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Weapons Left!Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.69,0:15:21.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're not getting away from me!Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.90,0:15:23.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Strong Right!Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.99,0:15:42.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Grandma, the Navy's on its way!Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.99,0:15:44.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's not good.Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.81,0:15:49.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin, stay here. I'll hold them back!Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.01,0:15:54.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here I come!Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.36,0:15:56.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thunder Charge:Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.01,0:16:01.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Swing Arm!Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.28,0:16:12.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thunder Ball!Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.17,0:16:14.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– What's this?! – Clouds?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.70,0:16:21.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thunderbolt Tempo!Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.20,0:16:24.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I did it!Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.52,0:16:27.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You think you can fight us with that joke of a weapon?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.56,0:16:28.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You pirate bitch!Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.68,0:16:40.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.90,0:16:46.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm part of the Straw Hats, too. When we fight, let's do so together.Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.94,0:16:52.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's more?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.81,0:16:57.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey there! We're hostages!Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.24,0:16:59.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're weak!Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.89,0:17:19.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay strong until Luffy gets here!Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.28,0:17:32.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shave!Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.78,0:17:38.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.16,0:17:42.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It seems that doping technique of yours is losing its edge.Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.91,0:17:47.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your struggle means nothing!Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.92,0:17:50.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Enies Lobby is your last stop after all!Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.96,0:17:52.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's just reality!Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.42,0:17:56.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rubber Rubber Jet Axe!Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.37,0:17:59.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't care if this island is destroyed in the process.Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.81,0:18:05.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That woman is a threat to the World Government's agenda.Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.67,0:18:08.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I will pursue her to the ends of the earth to eliminate her...Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.31,0:18:10.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,in the name of dark justice!Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.81,0:18:15.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We came here to take Robin away from all that!Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.70,0:18:18.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jet Stamp!Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.22,0:18:25.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Six King Gun!Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.61,0:19:28.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.00,0:19:33.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– I got him! – Watch out!Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.07,0:19:37.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Now's not the time to be spacing out, Soge–Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.82,0:19:51.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.23,0:19:55.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.60,0:20:00.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What're you doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.26,0:20:03.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get up!Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.22,0:20:07.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.27,0:20:10.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Weapons Left!Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.87,0:20:21.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Super!Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.84,0:20:26.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Commander!Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.66,0:20:28.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's with those pirates?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.28,0:20:31.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is insane! They're holding their own against captains!Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.71,0:20:43.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Does that woman have powers?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.26,0:20:46.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of her. Stay back!Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.71,0:20:52.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cien Fleur:Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.87,0:20:57.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Flip!Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.57,0:21:08.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here we go!Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.24,0:21:10.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thunder Ball!Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.32,0:21:14.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thunderbolt Tempo!Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.86,0:21:19.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That'll do!Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.20,0:21:32.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So I guess these guys aren't your typical grunts, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.41,0:21:38.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Two-Sword Style:Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.05,0:21:45.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hawk Surge!Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.98,0:21:51.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who's next?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.08,0:21:57.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp!Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.82,0:22:08.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.83,0:22:16.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.40,0:22:35.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,U-Usopp?Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.21,0:22:39.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,S-So... you came?Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.40,0:22:45.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,D-Don't get the wrong idea!Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.77,0:22:50.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm here to rescue Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.00,0:22:55.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I didn't come to see your face!Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.77,0:22:57.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn, what an ass!Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.00,0:23:04.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, you! CP9's boss cat!Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.46,0:23:11.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm talking to you! Now it's my turn! Bring it on!Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.81,0:23:21.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Th-That's right! I'm your opponent!Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.29,0:23:23.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.54,0:23:27.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey... don't! Don't! Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.61,0:23:31.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leave him alone!Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.01,0:23:34.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've already lost. I have no business with you.Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.36,0:23:38.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're all gonna die anyway.Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.14,0:23:40.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just stay right there and watch.Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.86,0:23:46.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right, come on, boss cat! I'm gonna blow you away!Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.42,0:23:51.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?! Stop it, Usopp! He'll kill you!Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.61,0:23:57.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up! What can you do when you're almost dead?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.30,0:24:02.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's mine! I'm gonna kick his ass!Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.98,0:24:06.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then get up already!Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.36,0:24:11.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop looking like you're about to die!Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.49,0:24:15.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not like you!Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.05,0:24:25.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There may be nothing but smoke above us, but we can still see the sky!Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.40,0:24:29.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can see the sea, too!Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.37,0:24:40.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're... We're not in hell!Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.14,0:24:50.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop acting like you're about to die, you jerk!Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.72,0:24:58.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't make us worry, dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.28,0:25:05.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know!Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.39,0:25:11.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This isn't hell or anything close to it.Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.28,0:25:15.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.75,0:25:28.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have to beat him! We're all going back together, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.59,0:25:32.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're damn right!Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.32,0:25:39.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you can still move?Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.78,0:25:46.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I never said... I'm done.Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.16,0:25:49.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Until I defeat you,Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.11,0:25:55.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't... hit the floor again!Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.42,0:26:02.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vital Response: Terminate.Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.94,0:26:08.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of this farce.Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.35,0:26:11.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My sheer power will crush you once and for all!Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.21,0:26:15.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about your friends, Straw Hat.Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.48,0:26:21.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Since you wish to be together with them again,Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.38,0:26:26.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll send them to join you in hell!Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.43,0:26:41.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Spots!Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.42,0:26:58.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.94,0:27:17.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Victory Bird!Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.13,0:27:26.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit! What's their deal?! I can't hit them!Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.58,0:27:37.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! I won!Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.67,0:27:39.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take this!Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.66,0:27:48.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Witness the power of the Berry Berry Fruit!Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.44,0:27:55.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit! I'm trapped!Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.22,0:27:59.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's nothing you can do!Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.70,0:28:01.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks!Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.24,0:28:05.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, you! Hold on a sec.Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.07,0:28:09.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you like flying so much...Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.11,0:28:10.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! D-Don't!Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.61,0:28:12.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Weapons Left!Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.69,0:28:18.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Careful! They've got ability users among them!Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.88,0:28:24.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They could say the same about us!Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.39,0:28:27.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Treinta Fleur: Clutch!Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.40,0:28:35.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you are Roronoa Zoro?Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.70,0:28:38.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And if I am?Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.12,0:28:41.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I will defeat you!Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.78,0:28:43.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fine!Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.98,0:28:52.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I ate the Rust Rust Fruit and became a rust man.Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.26,0:28:54.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You cannot defeat me.Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.44,0:28:57.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit! My Yubashiri!Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.27,0:29:03.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I will turn those swords you cherish to rust.Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.00,0:29:05.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How intriguing.Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.35,0:29:09.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's give it a test.Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.85,0:29:19.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now you get it, right? You cannot defeat me with swords!Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.24,0:29:26.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I... I can't move my body!Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.68,0:29:31.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I rusted your joint. I will continue until your entire body is rusted over!Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.49,0:29:32.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.66,0:29:34.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Firebird Star!Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.09,0:29:43.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Zoro-kun?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.76,0:29:54.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rubber Rubber Jet Pistol!Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.65,0:30:05.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rubber Rubber Jet Pistol!Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.82,0:30:09.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna take another one of those!Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.78,0:30:13.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ultimate Whorl:Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.50,0:30:16.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Six King Gun!Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.10,0:31:05.22,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Until I defeat you,Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.09,0:31:10.80,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,I won't... hit the floor again!Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.41,0:31:30.61,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,You'll soon regret that you took in such a vexatious woman.Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.20,0:31:33.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rubber Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.41,0:31:36.87,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,We're through. You'll never see me again.Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.25,0:31:41.58,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,This does not concern people like you.Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.71,0:31:46.34,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Robin intends to die for us!Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.22,0:31:50.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iron Body!Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.05,0:31:56.26,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Are you insane?! Don't think that you'll be able to survive...Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.26,0:31:58.14,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,after making the entire world your enemy!Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.68,0:32:02.94,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,I will pursue her to the ends of the earth to eliminate her...Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.15,0:32:05.57,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,I want to live!Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.15,0:32:10.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jet...Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.99,0:32:16.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gatling!Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.74,0:32:57.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.91,0:32:59.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened?!Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.09,0:33:04.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.67,0:33:05.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.00,0:33:09.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The first column!Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.60,0:33:16.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, what's that?Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.07,0:33:18.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Look over there!Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.43,0:33:20.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Th-This is a report to all ships.Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.79,0:33:22.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is a report to all ships!Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.93,0:33:26.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mr. Rob Lucci of CP9 was just...Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.60,0:33:34.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,was just defeated... by the pirate Straw Hat Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.98,0:33:41.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.81,0:33:51.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's over.Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.81,0:33:54.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll be okay now.Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.70,0:34:02.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna go back together!Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.21,0:34:08.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.78,0:34:23.74,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Galaxy 9000  Timing: PhosCity  Quality Control: danpmss, DolphinWeabu, ItsKipz, Galaxy 9000, Pepperjack  Soundtracking:  Halee  Graphics:  Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Translation: Crunchyroll, GaijinDialogue: 0,0:00:00.71,0:00:03.37,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Get running, get runningDialogue: 0,0:00:03.59,0:00:06.46,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,holding our flag high in the skyDialogue: 0,0:00:12.77,0:00:18.06,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Cross this endless sea with me and search for Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.86,0:00:21.81,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,a global miracle no oneDialogue: 0,0:00:21.90,0:00:23.94,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,has yet been able to findDialogue: 0,0:00:24.82,0:00:27.96,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,With our hearts pounding,Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.96,0:00:29.71,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we'll just charge ahead as we please, following Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.71,0:00:35.59,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,the footprints of those who pursue their dreams Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.42,0:00:39.39,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,No matter how stormy the night,Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.39,0:00:42.39,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,if we put our minds together, Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.39,0:00:46.54,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we'll get through it Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.68,0:00:47.86,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,alwaysDialogue: 0,0:00:48.76,0:00:51.59,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Get running, get runningDialogue: 0,0:00:51.72,0:00:54.55,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,holding our flag high in the skyDialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:57.14,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Even though there are tearsDialogue: 0,0:00:57.23,0:01:00.58,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we don't want anyone to seeDialogue: 0,0:01:00.77,0:01:03.52,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Keep chasing, keep chasing Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.69,0:01:06.52,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,the compass that leads to our dreams Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.61,0:01:09.23,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,always points straight ahead Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.23,0:01:11.40,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,We can't stop hereDialogue: 0,0:01:18.83,0:01:21.49,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Get running, get running,Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.80,0:01:24.54,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,head past everyone elseDialogue: 0,0:01:24.63,0:01:27.12,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,So long as we don't run from it,Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.22,0:01:30.54,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we can take hold of tomorrow Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.60,0:01:33.63,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Keep chasing, keep chasing Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:36.51,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,everything we see in the moment,Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.56,0:01:38.93,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we should record it all Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.15,0:01:41.43,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,in the blank slates of our minds Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.52,0:01:41.62,Kanji,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.98,Kar